    "question": {
      "en": "The curve $x^2+4y^2=20$ contains the point $(2,2)$. Find the slope of the tangent line at that point.",
      "ja": "曲線 $x^2+4y^2=20$ は点 $(2,2)$ を通ります。この点における接線の傾きを求めてください。"
    },
    "solution": {
      "en": "Differentiate: $2x+8y(dy/dx)=0$. Hence $dy/dx=-x/(4y)$. At $(2,2)$, the slope is $-1/4$.",
